OL,3,AGlobal stocks plunge as fears over US
OL,4,AAI slowdown spread to Asia and Europe
OL,5,
OL,6,FGlobal stock markets have tumbled after
OL,7,Finvestors sold tech shares on fears
OL,8,Fthat the US midterm elections would
OL,9,Fslow the development of artificial
OL,10,Fintelligence (AI).
OL,12,FThe sell-off, which started in the US
OL,13,Fand then spread to Asia and Europe, has
OL,14,Fseen trillions of dollars wiped off the
OL,15,Fstock value of major tech firms.
OL,17,FIn the US, the tech-heavy Nasdaq share
OL,18,Findex sank 5.5% on Thursday. Asian
OL,19,Fmarkets also saw hefty falls on Friday
OL,20,Fand European markets opened lower.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,107,105,200,160,0,100
