OL,3,AElon Musk appears to signal the end of
OL,4,Athe road for Cybertruck
OL,5,
OL,6,FWith its distinctive angular looks, the
OL,7,FCybertruck attracted diehard fans, but
OL,8,Fwas beset by delays before being
OL,9,Flaunched in 2023 and has had
OL,10,Fdisappointing sales numbers since.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/19
