OL,3,AOlivia Rodrigo's Christmas song sounds
OL,4,Afamiliar... on purpose
OL,5,
OL,6,FPop star Olivia Rodrigo unwrapped her
OL,7,Ffirst-ever Christmas song on Thursday
OL,8,Fnight, alongside a festive music video
OL,9,Fstarring Sex and the City star Cynthia
OL,10,FNixon.
OL,12,FThe track, called Take Me Home (4
OL,13,FChristmas), finds the pop star asking
OL,14,Fher boyfriend to "show some serious
OL,15,Fcommitment" by bringing her to his
OL,16,Fparents' house for the Christmas break.
OL,18,FAs soon as it was released, fans
OL,19,Fnoticed similarities to The Waitresses'
OL,20,F1981 festive hit Christmas Wrapping...
OL,21,FAnd it turns out that was by design
OL,22,Frather than mistake.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
