OL,3,AOlivia Rodrigo's Christmas song sounds
OL,4,Afamiliar... on purpose
OL,5,
OL,6,FChris Butler, who wrote The Waitresses'
OL,7,Fsong, posted a message on Facebook,
OL,8,Fsaying Rodrigo had contacted him to
OL,9,Fseek permission for the song; and
OL,10,Fpraising her "phenomenal" writing.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/19
